cff-version: 1.2.0
title: deap-er
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it and the original
  DEAP paper listed under references.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Aabmets
    given-names: Mattias
    email: mattias.aabmets@gmail.com
repository-code: https://github.com/aabmets/deap-er
url: https://aabmets.github.io/deap-er/
abstract: >-
  Distributed Evolutionary Algorithms in Python - Entirely Reinvented.
  A complete rewrite of the DEAP library for Python 3.12 and up.
keywords:
  - deap
  - evolution
  - evolutionary algorithms
  - genetic algorithms
  - genetic programming
  - symbolic regression
  - hypervolume
license: Apache-2.0
version: 3.0.0
references:
